        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "We could sneak away, fuck it, you can bring an eighth",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'm not gon' smoke, but I'm just asking, baby; could you meet me by the lake?",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Said bring a towel, well, baby, meet me by the lake",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Bathin' suit, it's going down, shit, just meet me by the lake",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "We could count the shooting stars, well, could you meet me by the lake?",
